80","parentId":null,"displayOrder":1,"isActive":true,"seoTitle":"Designer Sarees & Handloom Silk Sarees | Saubhagya Sarees Hisar","seoDescription":"Shop luxury Indian sarees in pure silk, organza, georgette, and banarasi weaves at Saubhagya Sarees & Bridal Studio.","createdAt":"$D2026-11-10T17:52:28.028Z","updatedAt":"$D2026-11-10T19:05:34.269Z"}},{"id":"cmwazmlz0002funv1uoie31ws","title":"Handwoven Royal Banarasi Katan Silk Saree","slug":"handwoven-royal-banarasi-katan-silk-saree","sku":"SBS-SR-0201","shortDescription":"Pure Katan silk Banarasi saree in deep wine maroon featuring intricate gold kadwa shikargah motifs and a grand pallu.","description":"A masterwork of generational weavers, this authentic Banarasi saree is woven with certified pure mulberry katan silk. The body features intricate kadwa floral jaal in antique gold zari, while the resplendent pallu showcases traditional royal shikargah motifs.\n\nComes with Silk Mark certification and includes an unstitched contrast brocade blouse piece.","price":"18500","mrp":"24000","discountPercent":23,"taxRate":"5","fabric":"Pure Katan Silk with Gold Zari","occasion":"Wedding Guest","primaryColor":"Wine Maroon","blouseDetails":"Unstitched heavy zari brocade blouse piece included","sareeLength":"5.5 meters saree + 0.8 meter blouse piece","suitComponents":null,"careInstructions":"Dry Clean Only. Iron on reverse using low temperature silk setting. Fold along zari creases carefully.","customizationAvailable":false,"isFeatured":true,"isBestseller":true,"isNewArrival":false,"status":"PUBLISHED","videoUrl":null,"categoryId":"cmwazmlx8001dunv1whs5mw27","collectionId":"cmwazmly0001munv1u1awyqqg","tags":"banarasi saree, katan silk, wine saree, zari pallu, bridal saree","viewsCount":0,"salesCount":0,"rating":"4.9","reviewCount":22,"seoTitle":null,"seoDescription":null,"createdAt":"$D2026-11-10T17:52:28.093Z","updatedAt":"$D2026-11-10T17:52:28.093Z","images":[{"id":"cmwb1h1w20007un82opirz66m","productId":"cmwazmlz0002funv1uoie31ws","url":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1604309232579-57b2a96dc946?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=80","alt":"Handwoven Royal Banarasi Katan Silk Saree view 1","displayOrder":0,"isPrimary":true,"createdAt":"$D2026-11-10T18:44:08.019Z"},{"id":"cmwb1h1w40009un82d1imrqft","productId":"cmwazmlz0002funv1uoie31ws","url":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1610189338344-f3ce0d0f6d06?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=80","alt":"Handwoven Royal Banarasi Katan Silk Saree view 2","displayOrder":1,"isPrimary":false,"createdAt":"$D2026-11-10T18:44:08.020Z"}],"variants":[{"id":"cmwazmlz6002lunv1z4u2932k","productId":"cmwazmlz0002funv1uoie31ws","title":"Standard Free Size","sku":"SBS-SR-0201-FREE","size":"Free Size","color":"Wine Maroon","colorHex":"#4A1525","additionalPrice":"0","stockQuantity":8,"createdAt":"$D2026-11-10T17:52:28.098Z","updatedAt":"$D2026-11-10T17:52:28.098Z"}],"category":{"id":"cmwazmlx8001dunv1whs5mw27","name":"Sarees","slug":"sarees","description":"Authentic Handloom Banarasi, Pure Kanjeevaram Silk & Organza Drapes","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1617627143750-d86bc21e42bb?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=80","bannerImage":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1617627143750-d86bc21e42bb?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=80","parentId":null,"displayOrder":1,"isActive":true,"seoTitle":"Designer Sarees & Handloom Silk Sarees | Saubhagya Sarees Hisar","seoDescription":"Shop luxury Indian sarees in pure silk, organza, georgette, and banarasi weaves at Saubhagya Sarees & Bridal Studio.","createdAt":"$D2026-11-10T17:52:28.028Z","updatedAt":"$D2026-11-10T19:05:34.269Z"}},{"id":"cmwazmly3001punv19u7mthhv","title":"Royal Crimson Zardozi Micro-Velvet Bridal Lehenga","slug":"royal-crimson-zardozi-velvet-bridal-lehenga","sku":"SBS-BR-0101","shortDescription":"Regal crimson micro-velvet bridal lehenga hand-embroidered with antique dabka, tilla, and sequins. Paired with dual dupattas.","description":"Step into timeless majesty with the Royal Crimson Zardozi Bridal Lehenga from the Saubhagya Bridal Studio. Crafted from rich micro-velvet, each panel is adorned with intricate mughal jaal motifs, handcrafted dabka, french knots, and gold badla work. \n\nThe ensemble includes a structured lehenga skirt with a 4.2-meter circular flare, an intricately embellished blouse with dori tie-ups, a deep crimson velvet shoulder dupatta, and a lightweight peach tissue veil dupatta with scalloped borders.","price":"68500","mrp":"89900","discountPercent":24,"taxRate":"5","fabric":"Pure Micro Velvet & Silk Organza","occasion":"Bridal","primaryColor":"Crimson Red","blouseDetails":"Padded custom-stitched blouse with antique gold tassels","sareeLength":null,"suitComponents":"Lehenga, Blouse, Velvet Dupatta, Tissue Veil Dupatta","careInstructions":"Dry Clean Only. Preserve wrapped in pure cotton muslin fabric. Avoid spraying perfumes directly on zardozi embellishments.","customizationAvailable":true,"isFeatured":true,"isBestseller":true,"isNewArrival":true,"status":"PUBLISHED","videoUrl":null,"categoryId":"cmwazmlxb001eunv1tct55imu","collectionId":"cmwazmlxx001lunv1z4rqwpjq","tags":"bridal lehenga, wedding, crimson red, velvet lehenga, zardozi, hisar bridal studio","viewsCount":0,"salesCount":1,"rating":"5","reviewCount":14,"seoTitle":null,"seoDescription":null,"createdAt":"$D2026-11-10T17:52:28.059Z","updatedAt":"$D2026-11-10T18:12:43.939Z","images":[{"id":"cmwb1h1vu0003un82n66c6qtl","productId":"cmwazmly3001punv19u7mthhv","url":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1610047614301-13c63f00c032?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=80","alt":"Royal Crimson Zardozi Micro-Velvet Bridal Lehenga view 1","displayOrder":0,"isPrimary":true,"createdAt":"$D2026-11-10T18:44:08.010Z"},{"id":"cmwb1h1vx0005un82mxcgqgl5","productId":"cmwazmly3001punv19u7mthhv","url":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1610047614256-023d7c028d0b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=80","alt":"Royal Crimson Zardozi Micro-Velvet Bridal Lehenga view 2","displayOrder":1,"isPrimary":false,"createdAt":"$D2026-11-